      "message": "test(app): read the troubleshooting sources with any line end\n\nThe docs_troubleshooting suite joined string literals that continue on the\nnext line with a backslash by splitting on backslash plus LF. On a checkout\nwith core.autocrlf=true the line end is CRLF, so the join did not match and\nthe stem was not found. One helper now brings every text that the test reads\nto LF first (the sources and the docs page). No assert and no stem changed.\n\nFixes #3619\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
